# 插件开发

## 模板

```typescript
export class FooPlugin implements IPluginTempl {
    static pluginName = "FooPlugin";
    static apis = ["fooAction"]; // 可选，挂载到 editor.fooAction

    pluginName = FooPlugin.pluginName;
    hotkeys?: string[];

    constructor(public editor: EditorCore) {}

    fooAction() { /* ... */ }

    hotkeyEvent = (name: string, e: KeyboardEvent) => {
        if (e.type !== "keyup") return;
        if (isEditableTargetFocused()) return; // input/textarea 时不拦截
    };

    destroy() { /* off 事件、cancel debounce */ }
}
```

## 要点

- 构造函数参数：`editor: EditorCore`（非 editorBoard）
- 选中/属性：`SelectEvent` 来自 `@/core/constants`
- 历史：`HistoryPlugin` 监听 `ChildEvent.ADD/REMOVE`，用 `tree.add/remove` 自动入栈
- 批量/加载：`editor.runWithoutRecording?.(() => { ... })`
- 连线：委托 `ConnectionPlugin`（`addConnection`、`removeConnectionsForNode`、`exportConnections`）
- 注册：加入 `DEFAULT_EDIT_PLUGINS` 并 `export` 于 `src/plugins/index.ts`
